      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">HostPapa VPS Review 2026: Carbon-Neutral Green Hosting From $19.99/mo</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-6">HostPapa is a family-owned Canadian web host that has been carbon-neutral since 2007 — well before "green hosting" became a marketing line. Their VPS plans start at $19.99/mo with NVMe SSD, free domain + SSL + Cloudflare CDN, and cPanel included. This deep-dive covers real pricing, the green hosting audit trail, who HostPapa is right for, and where to look instead if you need a $2/mo budget tier or an APAC datacenter.</p>
